THIRD-PARTY WORKS COMMITTED IN THIS REPOSITORY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Almost every dependency of this project is resolved at build time and is not
redistributed here. Three kinds are, and are therefore listed: fonts, committed
as binaries; component source copied into the tree rather than installed; and a
dataset snapshot committed so that nothing in the build has to fetch it.

Wikidata
  Structured data, dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  https://www.wikidata.org
  The CSV files under tools/catalogue/data/ are frozen results of the SPARQL
  queries committed beside them, retrieved 2026-08-11 from
  https://query.wikidata.org/sparql. They are the source deploy/catalogue.json's
  product titles, descriptions, manufacturers and airport codes are derived
  from. CC0 requires no attribution; this entry is provenance, and it records
  which committed files are not this project's own work.

  Only Wikidata's structured data is CC0. Media on Wikimedia Commons is not, and
  none is used: every image this repository ships is drawn by it, by hand under
  frontend/public/images/catalogue or by tools/catalogue/mark.go under the
  derived/ directory beside them.

